			"Message": "style(Mist): Replace em dashes with hyphens in CHANGELOG\n\nThe CHANGELOG.md used inconsistent dash styles - em dashes (—) in version headers and description, while Keep a Changelog format typically uses regular hyphens (-). This change standardizes all dashes to hyphens for consistency throughout the document.",
