			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mist): Complete import path refactoring in integration tests\n\nFinish updating the module imports in tests/integration.rs from Mist:: prefixed paths to direct module imports:\n- Change `Mist::forward_security::default_forward_allowlist()` to `ForwardSecurity::default_forward_allowlist()`\n- Change `Mist::zone::editor_land_zone()` to `Zone::editor_land_zone()`\n\nThis completes the import path refactoring started in b681ca8, aligning the integration tests with the updated module structure. Also adds a clarifying comment about the dns_port() dependency on Mist::start().",
			"SHA": "9b1633d5402500cdf6911c2851acd29031712fb7"
		},
